"Mrs. Zhang-Demir is Haoyu's mother, a slim brunette and an elite S-rank Dura Brute hero."
"She attended CNH, and she and her husband share the working name Omega Scorpii."
"Their hero group supplies pre-vetted heavy hitters to several governments in crises."
"Both parents are on call for different Anesidora battle groups, and avoid overlapping jobs."
"In recent years she is summoned more often for combat jobs with a team of alien Avowed."
"She mothers Alden Thorn, calling him sweetheart; her assistant is Molly, a telekinetic."
"She has a secrecy tattoo from demon suppression and holds two chaos-fighting commendations."
"Her first name is Hale; her husband is Zhang Jianwei, also titled Omega Scorpii."
